OL,5,G0045 Uncharted with Ray Goggins
OL,6,     FParalympian Ellen Keane and
OL,7,     FCamogie star Ashling Thompson
OL,8,     Ftravel to Bolivia to the start of
OL,9,     F'Death Road' to meet Ray Goggins
OL,10,     Fand embark on a gruelling a
OL,11,     Fseven-day challenge.
OL,12,G0145 Any Given Day: Cork University
OL,13,G     Hospital
OL,14,     FIn episode two, a 4-year-old girl
OL,15,     Fis being rushed to hospital by
OL,16,     Fambulance. She is suffering
OL,17,     Fprolonged seizures. Her condition
OL,18,     Fcontinues to deteriorate enroute
OL,19,     Fto hospital.
